1
00:00:00,271 --> 00:00:01,771
(Raj:)Please, sit.

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,310
(Raj:)I got you a cappuccino.
I remembered it was your favourite.

3
00:00:04,475 --> 00:00:06,475
(Raj:)I also got crumb cake,

4
00:00:06,744 --> 00:00:08,724
but remembered
it was my favourite, and I ate it.

5
00:00:10,915 --> 00:00:12,415
Anyway, how are you?

6
00:00:13,384 --> 00:00:14,834
(Lucy:)I'm pretty good.

7
00:00:14,986 --> 00:00:16,796
(Lucy:)Listen, I just wanted to apologize

8
00:00:16,954 --> 00:00:19,124
(Lucy:)for breaking up with you
in an e-mail.

9
00:00:19,323 --> 00:00:21,273
(Raj:)And I ate all the crumb cake.
We both made mistakes.

10
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:23,964
(Leonard:)Okay.

11
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:26,108
(Raj:)I'm so happy you asked me here,

12
00:00:26,264 --> 00:00:28,304
(Raj:)and I hope we can hang out
again sometime.

13
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,140
(Raj:)You know, as friends,
lovemaking partners, whatever.

14
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:35,438
(Leonard:)Oh...

15
00:00:35,573 --> 00:00:37,643
(Lucy:)I'm kind of seeing someone.

16
00:00:39,844 --> 00:00:41,254
(Raj:)I think I know the answer to this,

17
00:00:41,412 --> 00:00:44,292
(Raj:)but just to be clear,
it's not me, right?

18
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:47,700
This is all your fault!

19
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,820
(Raj:)I should've listened to Mun-Mun
because I've been playing

20
00:00:50,988 --> 00:00:53,028
with a cobra and her name is Penny!

21
00:00:54,459 --> 00:00:57,169
(Raj:)Why are you so cruel?
Do you enjoy my pain?

22
00:00:57,295 --> 00:00:59,335
(Penny:)There's a girl at the Cheesecake
Factory I can set you up with.

